{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"card":1,"entry":2,"missions":33,"alongside":34,"kin":35,"engines":60,"usedOn":61,"sites":62,"crewed":63,"museums":64,"hero":65},"https://www.orrerylearn.com/images/cards/fleet/ariane-6.jpg",{"id":3,"name":4,"category":5,"agency":6,"country":7,"manufacturer":8,"first_flight":9,"status":10,"era":11,"epoch":12,"best_known_for":13,"credit":14,"links":15,"specs":28,"tagline":13,"dispatch":31,"description":32},"ariane-6","Ariane 6","launcher","ESA","Multi (Europe)","ArianeGroup","2024-07-09","ACTIVE","2011-now","commercial-era","Ariane 5的继承人","Skeleton entry for /fleet (PRD-012 v0.2 / Phase A scaffold). Builder + agency + first-flight per public sources. Specs and gallery TBD in later phases.",[16,20,24],{"l":17,"u":18,"t":19},"Ariane 6 — Wikipedia","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ariane_6","intro",{"l":21,"u":22,"t":23},"Ariane 6 — ESA","https://www.esa.int/Enabling_Support/Space_Transportation/Launch_vehicles/Ariane_6","core",{"l":25,"u":26,"t":27},"Ariane 6 maiden flight VA262 (ESA)","https://www.esa.int/Enabling_Support/Space_Transportation/Ariane/Europe_s_new_Ariane_6_rocket_powers_into_space","deep",{"height_m":29,"diameter_m":30},63,5.4,"Ariane 6是欧洲对一个自己已不再主导的市场所作的回应。二十年来，Ariane统治着商业发射；后来可重复使用火箭用更低的价格压低了它的行情，终结了这段统治。2024年起飞行的Ariane 6，是既有强者对颠覆者的回应——比Ariane 5更便宜、更灵活，旨在在发射经济学被围绕着它重写的同时，守住欧洲独立进入太空的能力。一枚一次性火箭能否在可重复使用的对手面前站稳脚跟，是它如今背负的悬而未决的问题。","Ariane 6是ArianeGroup在欧洲研制的轨道运载火箭。Ariane 5的继任者。2024年起服役。",[],[],[36,40,44,48,52,56],{"id":37,"name":38,"tagline":39},"ariane-5","Ariane 5","发射了Rosetta、JWST、Galileo卫星导航系统（ESA）",{"id":41,"name":42,"tagline":43},"h3","H3","以较低费用取代H-IIA/H-IIB",{"id":45,"name":46,"tagline":47},"vulcan","Vulcan Centaur","Atlas V 与 Delta IV 的继任者；将获 NSSL 第 3 阶段认证，并计划发射 Dream Chaser",{"id":49,"name":50,"tagline":51},"new-glenn","New Glenn","Blue Origin 的两级可重复使用重型轨道运载火箭",{"id":53,"name":54,"tagline":55},"starship","Starship","完全可重复使用的超重型运载火箭",{"id":57,"name":58,"tagline":59},"sls-block-1","SLS Block 1","Artemis月球方案的重载",[],[],[],[],[],"/orrery/images/fleet-galleries/ariane-6/01.webp"],"uses":{"params":["id"]}}]}
